Package: fsct-driver
Version: 0.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: HEM Sp. z o.o. <info@hem-e.com>
Depends: systemd (>= 245), adduser | passwd
Description: FSCT Host services (driver and per-user client)
 FSCT provides a system-wide driver daemon and per-user client integration for Ferrum Streaming Control Technology(R).
 It allows to send current player states to connected devices.
 Per user clients are used to gather information about the current player state from the system (MPRIS via D-BUS).
 Additionally, supported players can cmomunicate with the driver directly.
